IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BXPIPE.

*> Inbound external message processing pipeline (GATE 3).  Stages, in
*> order: receive -> schema validation -> security validation ->
*> identity/idempotency -> contract normalization -> core operation ->
*> response/outcome persistence.  The pipeline never applies financial
*> effects itself: normalization maps the external message onto the
*> existing core contract (BPXSTX) and the core owns the ledger.  Unknown
*> core outcomes stay UNKNOWN here and are routed to correlation, never
*> blind-retried.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-T      PIC X(16).
01 WS-VER    PIC X(05).
01 WS-MSGNM  PIC X(20).
01 WS-E2E    PIC X(32).
01 WS-GROSS  PIC X(18).
01 WS-INIF   PIC X(06).
01 WS-X9     PIC X(15).
01 WS-PDOC   PIC X(15).
01 WS-RDOC   PIC X(15).
01 WS-DDOC   PIC X(15).
01 WS-TAX    PIC X(500).
01 WS-REFNB  PIC X(30).
01 WS-PACC   PIC X(12).
01 WS-PCUS   PIC X(20).
01 WS-TAIL   PIC X(300).
01 WS-CANON  PIC X(2000).
01 WS-FPBUF  PIC X(2100).
01 WS-FPLEN  PIC 9(04).
01 WS-FPNEW  PIC X(16).
01 WS-SEAM   PIC X(24).
01 WS-RGI    PIC 9(04).
01 WS-LGI    PIC 9(04).
01 WS-LGJ    PIC 9(04).
01 WS-RGR    PIC X(200) OCCURS 4 TIMES.
01 WS-P1     PIC X(12).
01 WS-P2     PIC X(20).
01 WS-P3     PIC X(12).
01 WS-P4     PIC X(12).
01 WS-P5     PIC X(12).
01 WS-P6     PIC X(20).
01 WS-P7     PIC X(12).
01 WS-P8     PIC X(20).
01 WS-P9     PIC X(12).
01 WS-P10    PIC X(24).
01 WS-SIGIN  PIC X(64).
01 WS-RCIG   PIC X(02).
01 WS-NOW PIC X(14).
01 WS-IN-MSGID PIC X(32).
01 WS-IN-CERTID PIC X(24).
01 WS-IN-SIGN   PIC X(64).
COPY "BPXCFG".
COPY "BPTXP".
COPY "BKCFTP".
COPY "BKAUDP".
01 WS-BND-PAYLOAD PIC X(2000).
COPY "BKMIDP".

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BKBNDP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-BND-PARMS.
    MOVE "00" TO BD-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO BD-MSG BD-STATE BD-OUTCOME BD-CLASS BD-CORR
        BD-RETRYABLE
    MOVE "N" TO BD-RETRYABLE
    MOVE BD-MSG-ID TO WS-IN-MSGID
    MOVE BD-CERT-ID TO WS-IN-CERTID
    MOVE BD-SIGNATURE TO WS-IN-SIGN
    MOVE BD-MSG-ID TO WS-IN-MSGID
    MOVE BD-CERT-ID TO WS-IN-CERTID
    MOVE BD-SIGNATURE TO WS-IN-SIGN
    ACCEPT WS-SEAM FROM ENVIRONMENT "KOF_BND_SEAM"
    CALL "BPXCFG" USING BK-PX-CFG
    MOVE PC-ENVIRONMENT TO BD-ENV
    IF PC-ENVIRONMENT = "PRODUCTION"
        MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "PRODUCTION INBOUND ADAPTER NOT INSTALLED"
            TO BD-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF PC-ENVIRONMENT NOT = "LOCAL_DOUBLE" AND
       PC-ENVIRONMENT NOT = "QA"
        MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "ENVIRONMENT UNKNOWN OR MISSING" TO BD-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF BD-CHANNEL = SPACES
        MOVE "SPI" TO BD-CHANNEL
    END-IF
*> STAGE 1: receive + schema validation
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-T WS-VER WS-MSGNM WS-E2E WS-GROSS WS-INIF
        WS-X9 WS-PDOC WS-RDOC WS-DDOC WS-TAX WS-REFNB WS-PACC
        WS-PCUS WS-TAIL
    IF WS-SEAM = "MALFORMED_RESPONSE"
        PERFORM SCHEMA-REJECT
        MOVE "MALFORMED MESSAGE" TO BD-MSG
        PERFORM RECORD-REJECTED
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    UNSTRING FUNCTION TRIM(BD-PAYLOAD) DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO WS-T WS-VER WS-MSGNM WS-E2E WS-GROSS WS-INIF
        WS-PDOC WS-RDOC WS-DDOC WS-X9 WS-REFNB WS-TAX WS-PACC
        WS-PCUS WS-TAIL
    END-UNSTRING
    IF WS-T NOT = "spi.tax.ingest"
        PERFORM SCHEMA-REJECT
        MOVE "UNSUPPORTED INBOUND OP" TO BD-MSG
        PERFORM RECORD-REJECTED
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF WS-VER NOT = FUNCTION TRIM(PC-SPI-VER)
        PERFORM SCHEMA-REJECT
        STRING "UNSUPPORTED MESSAGE VERSION " DELIMITED SIZE
            FUNCTION TRIM(WS-VER) DELIMITED SIZE INTO BD-MSG
        END-STRING
        PERFORM RECORD-REJECTED
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF WS-MSGNM NOT = "pacs.008" AND
       WS-MSGNM NOT = "pain.013" AND
       WS-MSGNM NOT = "camt.054" AND
       WS-MSGNM NOT = "pacs.002" AND
       WS-MSGNM NOT = "pain.014"
        PERFORM SCHEMA-REJECT
        MOVE "UNSUPPORTED MESSAGE NAME" TO BD-MSG
        PERFORM RECORD-REJECTED
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF WS-E2E = SPACES
        PERFORM SCHEMA-REJECT
        MOVE "MISSING END TO END IDENTITY" TO BD-MSG
        PERFORM RECORD-REJECTED
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-VER TO BD-VER
    MOVE WS-MSGNM TO BD-FAMILY
    MOVE WS-E2E TO BD-E2E-ID
    MOVE WS-REFNB TO BD-CORR
    COMPUTE BD-AMOUNT = FUNCTION NUMVAL(WS-GROSS)
    MOVE PC-CURRENCY TO BD-CURRENCY
*> STAGE 2: security validation (certificate + signature)
    IF BD-CERT-ID NOT = SPACES
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-CANON
        STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-IN-MSGID) DELIMITED SIZE "|"
            DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2E) DELIMITED SIZE
            "|" DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(WS-GROSS)
            DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
            FUNCTION TRIM(WS-MSGNM) DELIMITED SIZE
            INTO WS-CANON
        END-STRING
        MOVE SPACES TO BK-CRT-PARMS
        MOVE "VERIFY" TO CT-OP
        MOVE WS-IN-CERTID TO CT-ID
        MOVE WS-CANON TO WS-BND-PAYLOAD
        MOVE WS-IN-SIGN TO WS-SIGIN
        IF WS-SEAM = "SECURITY_FAILURE"
            MOVE "TAMPERED-SIGNATURE" TO WS-SIGIN
        END-IF
        CALL "BSEC" USING BK-CRT-PARMS WS-BND-PAYLOAD WS-SIGIN
        IF CT-RC NOT = "00"
            MOVE "21" TO BD-RC
            MOVE CT-MSG TO BD-MSG
            MOVE "SECURITY" TO BD-STATE
            PERFORM RECORD-REJECTED
            GOBACK
        END-IF
    END-IF
*> STAGE 3: identity and idempotency (registry keyed by MsgId)
    IF BD-MSG-ID = SPACES
        MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "INBOUND MESSAGE ID REQUIRED" TO BD-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM BUILD-FP
    MOVE WS-FPNEW TO BD-FP
    PERFORM REG-BEGIN
    IF WS-RCIG = "22"
        PERFORM REG-GET
        IF WS-FPNEW NOT = BD-FP
            MOVE "26" TO BD-RC
            MOVE "MESSAGE REUSE WITH DIFFERENT PAYLOAD"
                TO BD-MSG
            MOVE BD-STATE TO BD-STATE-IN
            GOBACK
        END-IF
        IF BD-STATE = "POSTED" OR BD-STATE = "NOTIF"
            MOVE "00" TO BD-RC
            MOVE BD-STATE TO BD-STATE-IN
            MOVE "REPLAY" TO BD-OUTCOME
            MOVE "ACKED" TO BD-CLASS
            MOVE "Y" TO BD-CORR
            MOVE "INBOUND REPLAY NO NEW EFFECT" TO BD-MSG
            GOBACK
        END-IF
        IF BD-STATE = "REJECTED"
            MOVE "20" TO BD-RC
            MOVE BD-STATE TO BD-STATE-IN
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO BD-OUTCOME
            MOVE "RJCT" TO BD-CLASS
            MOVE "INBOUND REPLAY OF REJECTION" TO BD-MSG
            GOBACK
        END-IF
    ELSE
        IF WS-RCIG NOT = "00" AND WS-RCIG NOT = SPACES
            MOVE WS-RCIG TO BD-RC
            MOVE "REGISTRY FAILURE PROTECTING REPLAY" TO BD-MSG
            GOBACK
        END-IF
    END-IF
*> STAGE 4+5: normalization and core operation
    IF WS-SEAM = "CRASH_BEFORE_RESPERSIST"
        MOVE "90" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "SIMULATED CRASH BEFORE RESPONSE PERSISTED"
            TO BD-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM RUN-CORE
    IF BD-RC NOT = "00"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
*> STAGE 6: response/outcome persistence
    PERFORM RECORD-RESULT
    IF WS-SEAM = "CRASH_AFTER_RESPERSIST"
        MOVE "90" TO BD-RC
        MOVE "SIMULATED CRASH AFTER RESPONSE PERSISTED"
            TO BD-MSG
    END-IF
    GOBACK.

BUILD-FP.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-FPBUF
    MOVE 2100 TO WS-FPLEN
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-MSGNM) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2E) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-GROSS) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-PDOC) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-RDOC) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-DDOC) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-REFNB) DELIMITED SIZE "|" DELIMITED SIZE
        FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TAIL) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO WS-FPBUF
    END-STRING
    CALL "BHSH" USING WS-FPBUF WS-FPLEN WS-FPNEW.

SCHEMA-REJECT.
    MOVE "21" TO BD-RC
    MOVE "REJECTED" TO BD-STATE
    MOVE "RJCT" TO BD-CLASS.

REG-BEGIN.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-MSGID-PARMS
    MOVE "IDM-BEGIN" TO MD-OP
    MOVE WS-IN-MSGID TO MD-MSG-ID
    MOVE BD-VER TO MD-VER
    MOVE BD-FAMILY TO MD-FAMILY
    MOVE BD-E2E-ID TO MD-E2E
    MOVE WS-FPNEW TO MD-FP
    MOVE BD-ENV TO MD-ENV
    MOVE BD-CHANNEL TO MD-CHANNEL
    MOVE BD-AMOUNT TO MD-AMOUNT
    MOVE BD-CURRENCY TO MD-CURRENCY
    CALL "BXMSGID" USING BK-MSGID-PARMS
    MOVE MD-RC TO WS-RCIG.

REG-GET.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-MSGID-PARMS
    MOVE "IDM-GET" TO MD-OP
    MOVE WS-IN-MSGID TO MD-MSG-ID
    CALL "BXMSGID" USING BK-MSGID-PARMS
    MOVE MD-RC TO WS-RCIG.
    MOVE MD-STATE TO BD-STATE
    MOVE MD-FP TO BD-FP
    MOVE MD-PIX TO BD-OP-ID
    MOVE MD-TXN TO BD-INTERNAL
    MOVE MD-JRN TO BD-EXT-REF.

REG-COMPLETE.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-MSGID-PARMS
    MOVE "IDM-COMPLETE" TO MD-OP
    MOVE WS-IN-MSGID TO MD-MSG-ID
    MOVE BD-STATE TO MD-STATE
    MOVE XT-PIX-ID TO MD-PIX
    MOVE XT-TXN-ID TO MD-TXN
    MOVE XT-JRN-ID TO MD-JRN
    CALL "BXMSGID" USING BK-MSGID-PARMS
    MOVE MD-RC TO WS-RCIG.

RECORD-REJECTED.
    IF WS-IN-MSGID = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-MSGID-PARMS
    MOVE "IDM-FAIL" TO MD-OP
    MOVE WS-IN-MSGID TO MD-MSG-ID
    MOVE "REJECTED" TO MD-STATE
    CALL "BXMSGID" USING BK-MSGID-PARMS.

RUN-CORE.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-SPITAX-PARMS
    MOVE "TX-INGEST" TO XT-OP
    MOVE "BRL" TO XT-CURRENCY
    MOVE WS-INIF TO XT-INITFORM
    MOVE WS-VER TO XT-VER
    MOVE WS-MSGNM TO XT-MSGNM
    MOVE WS-E2E TO XT-E2E-ID
    MOVE WS-GROSS TO XT-GROSS-STR
    MOVE WS-PDOC TO XT-PAYER-DOC
    MOVE WS-RDOC TO XT-RECV-DOC
    MOVE WS-DDOC TO XT-DEBTOR-DOC
    MOVE BD-MSG-ID TO XT-MSGR-ID
    MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
    MOVE SPACES TO XT-CREATTM
    STRING WS-NOW(1:4) DELIMITED SIZE "-" DELIMITED SIZE
        WS-NOW(5:2) DELIMITED SIZE "-" DELIMITED SIZE
        WS-NOW(7:2) DELIMITED SIZE "T" DELIMITED SIZE
        WS-NOW(9:2) DELIMITED SIZE ":" DELIMITED SIZE
        WS-NOW(11:2) DELIMITED SIZE ":00.000Z" DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO XT-CREATTM
    END-STRING
    PERFORM PARSE-TAX-RECORDS
    IF WS-RGI < 1
        MOVE "N" TO XT-HAS-TAX
    ELSE
        MOVE "Y" TO XT-HAS-TAX
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-RGI TO XT-RCNT
    MOVE WS-REFNB TO XT-REFNB
    MOVE WS-PACC TO XT-PAYER-ACCT
    MOVE WS-PCUS TO XT-PAYER-CUST
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-P1 WS-P2 WS-P3 WS-P4 WS-P5 WS-P6 WS-P7
        WS-P8 WS-P9 WS-P10
    UNSTRING WS-TAIL DELIMITED BY ","
        INTO WS-P1 WS-P2 WS-P3 WS-P4 WS-P5 WS-P6 WS-P7 WS-P8
            WS-P9 WS-P10
    END-UNSTRING
    MOVE WS-P1 TO XT-RECV-ACCT
    MOVE WS-P2 TO XT-RECV-CUST
    MOVE WS-P3 TO XT-RECV-PART
    MOVE WS-P4 TO XT-PAYER-PART
    MOVE WS-P5 TO XT-TAX-CBS-ACCT
    MOVE WS-P6 TO XT-TAX-CBS-CUST
    MOVE WS-P7 TO XT-TAX-IBS-ACCT
    MOVE WS-P8 TO XT-TAX-IBS-CUST
    MOVE WS-P9 TO XT-OPERATOR
    MOVE WS-P10 TO XT-REQ
    MOVE "SPI INBOUND VIA PIPELINE" TO XT-DESCR
    CALL "BPXSTX" USING BK-SPITAX-PARMS
    MOVE XT-RC TO BD-RC
    MOVE XT-MSG TO BD-MSG
    IF XT-STATUS NOT = SPACES
        MOVE XT-STATUS TO BD-STATE
    END-IF
    MOVE XT-PIX-ID TO BD-OP-ID
    MOVE XT-TXN-ID TO BD-INTERNAL
    MOVE XT-JRN-ID TO BD-EXT-REF.

PARSE-TAX-RECORDS.
    MOVE 0 TO WS-RGI
    PERFORM VARYING WS-LGI FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-LGI > 4
        MOVE SPACES TO XT-R-TY(WS-LGI) XT-R-CT(WS-LGI)
            XT-R-VSTR(WS-LGI) XT-R-CCY(WS-LGI)
        MOVE 0 TO XT-R-AMT(WS-LGI)
    END-PERFORM
    IF WS-TAX = SPACES
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    UNSTRING WS-TAX DELIMITED BY ";" INTO WS-RGR(1)
        WS-RGR(2) WS-RGR(3) WS-RGR(4) TALLYING WS-RGI
    END-UNSTRING
    PERFORM VARYING WS-LGI FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-LGI > WS-RGI
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-P1 WS-P2 WS-P3 WS-P4 WS-P5 WS-P6
            WS-P7 WS-P8
        UNSTRING WS-RGR(WS-LGI) DELIMITED BY ":"
            INTO WS-P1 WS-P2 WS-P3 WS-P4 WS-P5 WS-P6 WS-P7
                WS-P8
        END-UNSTRING
        MOVE WS-P1 TO XT-R-TY(WS-LGI)
        MOVE WS-P2 TO XT-R-CT(WS-LGI)
        MOVE WS-P3 TO XT-R-VSTR(WS-LGI)
        MOVE WS-P4 TO XT-R-CCY(WS-LGI)
    END-PERFORM.
    EXIT PARAGRAPH.

RECORD-RESULT.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-AUD-PARMS
    MOVE "BND-INBOUND" TO BK-AUD-ACTION
    MOVE WS-IN-MSGID(1:24) TO BK-AUD-ENTITY
    MOVE BD-CORR TO BK-AUD-CORR
    MOVE BD-ENV TO BK-AUD-AFTER
    MOVE BD-RC TO BK-AUD-RESULT
    MOVE "SYSTEM" TO BK-AUD-OPERATOR
    CALL "BAUD" USING BK-AUD-PARMS
    IF BD-RC = "00"
        IF XT-STATUS = "POSTED" OR XT-STATUS = "ACCEPTED"
            MOVE "POSTED" TO BD-STATE
            MOVE "ACKED" TO BD-CLASS
            MOVE "ACKED" TO BD-OUTCOME
            PERFORM REG-COMPLETE
        ELSE
            IF XT-STATUS = "NOTIF"
                MOVE "NOTIF" TO BD-STATE
                MOVE "ACKED" TO BD-CLASS
                MOVE "NOTIF" TO BD-OUTCOME
                PERFORM REG-COMPLETE
            ELSE
                MOVE "24" TO BD-RC
                MOVE "CORE OUTCOME UNKNOWN CORRELATE" TO BD-MSG
                MOVE "UNK" TO BD-CLASS
                MOVE "N" TO BD-RETRYABLE
                MOVE "Y" TO BD-CORRELATE
            END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        IF BD-RC = "20" OR BD-RC = "21"
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO BD-STATE
            MOVE "RJCT" TO BD-CLASS
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO BD-OUTCOME
            PERFORM REG-COMPLETE
        ELSE
            IF BD-RC = "22" OR BD-RC = "26"
                CONTINUE
            ELSE
                MOVE "N" TO BD-RETRYABLE
                MOVE "Y" TO BD-CORRELATE
                MOVE "UNK" TO BD-CLASS
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF.
